s if the unwanted objects were never part of the photo.\"},\"3\":{\"name\":\"User-Friendly Interface:\",\"description\":\"Magic Eraser offers a simple and intuitive interface that doesn't require any prior knowledge or expertise in photo editing. Users can simply upload their image, use the brush tool to paint over the elements they wish to remove, and let the tool do the rest, making it accessible to everyone regardless of their technical skills.\"},\"p1\":\"Remove any you unwanted object from your images in seconds\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"What types of objects can I remove with the Magic Eraser?\",\"answer\":\"You can remove a variety of unwanted elements such as people, objects, text, watermarks, and more from your photos.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"Is there a size limit for the images I can upload?\",\"answer\":\"Free users can download images up to 720px, while subscribers can download images up to 2k resolution.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"How long does it take to remove an object from a photo?\",\"answer\":\"The process is very quick, typically taking only 2 seconds to remove an object from a picture.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"Do I need to have any prior photo editing experience to use Magic Eraser?\",\"answer\":\"No, the tool is designed to be user-friendly and accessible, so you don't need any prior knowledge or experience in photo editing.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"Can I use Magic Eraser on mobile devices?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the tool is available online and can be accessed from any device with an internet connection, including mobile devices.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"How do I download my edited photo after using Magic Eraser?\",\"answer\":\"After you've made the desired changes, you can download your edited image as a PNG file.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"p1\":\"Have a different question and can't find the answer you're looking for? Reach out to our support team by email \u003cmailTo\u003e\u003c/mailTo\u003e and we'll get back to you as