w:\",\"description\":\"Users can preview the AI-generated results in real-time during the editing process, ensuring that the final outcome meets expectations.\"},\"p1\":\"Remove unwanted object by Edit Anything\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"How does the Edit Anything tool work?\",\"answer\":\"The tool likely uses AI algorithms to analyze the surrounding areas of the image and generate content that matches the style and context to fill in the selected area.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"What types of images can I edit with Edit Anything?\",\"answer\":\"Users can edit a wide range of images, including photographs and digital art, as long as the image format is supported by the tool.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"How do I select the area I want to fill?\",\"answer\":\"There might be an interface within the tool that allows users to trace or highlight the area they wish to fill with AI-generated content.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"Can I undo or redo edits made with Edit Anything?\",\"answer\":\"The tool may provide standard editing controls, such as undo and redo, to allow users to refine their edits.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"How long does it take for the AI to fill an area in an image?\",\"answer\":\"The processing time can vary depending on the complexity of the image and the area being filled, as well as the power of the AI model being used.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"Are there any limitations on the size or resolution of the images I can edit?\",\"answer\":\"There could be limitations based on the capabilities of the AI model and the platform's processing power, which might restrict very large or high-resolution images.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"p1\":\"Have a different question and can't find the answer you're looking for? Reach out to our support team by email \u003cmailTo\u003e\u003c/mailTo\u003e and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.\"},\"testimonials\":{\"p1\":\"They Love Edit Anything\"}}},\"image-upscaler\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Image Scaler\",\"description\":\"Upscale your image up to 4K by AI.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Image Upscaler: AI-Powered Image Upscaling Solution\",\"p1\":\"Image Upscaler is a online tool that uses advanced AI technology to upscale images by 400% without losing quality.\",\"upload-image\":\"Upload Image\",\"drop-image\":\"or drop an image here\",\"paste-image\":\"paste image or URL\",\"download\":\"Download\",\"upload-image-message\":\"Please upload an image file.\",\"paste-image-message\":\"Please paste an image link.\",\"image-blocked-message\":\"\\\"{imgUrl}\\\" cannot be uploaded.\",\"max-size-message\":\"JPG or PNG, maximum size of 5MB or {maxPixel}\",\"one-time-message\":\"Only one image can be upscaled at a time\",\"upscale\":\"Upscale\",\"success-message\":\"{creditCount} credits have been deducted from your account.\",\"max-size-error-message\":\"The maximum size for images is 5MB or {maxPixel} pixels. We will resize the image for you.\"},\"features\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"High-Quality Image Upscaling:\",\"description\":\"ImgUpscaler uses advanced AI technology to increase the size of images by up to 400% while maintaining the original quality.\"},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Batch Processing Capability:\",\"description\":\"This tool allows users to upscale multiple images at once, making it incredibly efficient for processing large batches of photos. This feature is particularly useful for professionals who need to enhance a significant number of images quickly.\"},\"3\":{\"name\":\"User-Friendly Interface and Privacy Protection:\",\"description\":\" ImgUpscaler offers a simple drag-and-drop interface for easy use, and it ensures user privacy by clearing all photos within 24 hours. Additionally, the service is free for commercial use, with no hidden fees, providing peace of mind for users and businesses alike.\"},\"p1\":\"Best Image Upscale and Refinement Solutions\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"What file formats does Image Upscaler support?\",\"answer\":\"ImgUpscaler supports the most common image formats, including JPG, PNG, and JPEG.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"Can I use Image Upscaler for free?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, free user can upscale images up to a maximum dimension of 4000px.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"How much does it cost to upscale larger images or use batch processing?\",\"answer\":\"Upscale to 200% at once consumes 2 credits, and upscale to 200% at once consumes 4 credits.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"Is there a size limit for the images I can upscale?\",\"answer\":\" Free user can upscale images up to 5MB or 1024px in size，subscriber can upscale images up to 5MB or 1536px in size.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"How does Image Upscaler protect user privacy?\",\"answer\":\"ImgUpscaler ensures your privacy by clearing all uploaded photos within 24 hours after processing.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"Can I use the upscaled images for commercial purposes?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, all upscaled and enhanced images can be used for commercial use without any additional fees or restrictions.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"p1\":\"Have a different question and can't find the answer you're looking for? Reach out to our support team by email \u003cmailTo\u003e\u003c/mailTo\u003e and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.\"},\"testimonials\":{\"p1\":\"They Love Image Upscaler\"}},\"ai-clothes-changer\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"AI Clothes Changer\",\"description\":\"Change Clothes freely with lastest AI Technology.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"AI Clothes Changer\",\"p1\":\" With just one upload, our AI Clothes Changer gets to work immediately, swapping out clothes to match your desired look.\",\"half-body\":\"Half-body\",\"full-body\":\"Full-body\",\"upload-image\":\"Upload Image\",\"upload\":\"Upload\",\"drop-image\":\"or drop an image here\",\"paste-image\":\"paste image or URL\",\"upload-image-message\":\"Please upload an image file.\",\"paste-image-message\":\"Please paste an image link.\",\"image-blocked-message\":\"\\\"{imgUrl}\\\" cannot be uploaded.\",\"model\":\"Model\",\"garment\":\"Garment\",\"run\":\"Generate\",\"upper-body\":\"Upper-body\",\"lower-body\":\"Lower-body\",\"dress\":\"Dress\",\"please-select\":\"Please Select\",\"garment-category\":\"Garment category(\u003cspan\u003erequired option!!!\u003c/span\u003e)\",\"image-cropper\":{\"title\":\"Image Cropper\",\"cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"crop\":\"Crop\"},\"success-message\":\"2 credits have been deducted from your account.\"},\"features\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"AI-Powered Outfit Transformation:\",\"description\":\"AI Clothes Changer allows users to virtually change the clothes of individuals in photos. This feature might use machine learning algorithms to recognize the subject and apply new outfits seamlessly.\"},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Variety of Outfit Options:\",\"description\":\"Users may have access to a wide selection of clothing items and styles to choose from, enabling them to customize the look of their photos in a fun and creative way.\"},\"3\":{\"name\":\"Easy and Fast Editing Process:\",\"description\":\"The AI Change Clothes feature is likely designed to be user-friendly, allowing for quick and simple outfit changes with just a few clicks or taps, making photo editing accessible to everyone regardless of their technical skills.\"},\"p1\":\"Instantly Change Clothes with AI\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"How does the AI Clothes Changer work?\",\"answer\":\"The AI Clothes Changer feature utilizes machine learning to detect the subject in the photo and their clothing. Users can then choose from a variety of digital outfits to apply, and the AI seamlessly overlays these onto the image.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"What kinds of outfits can I select for the AI Clothes Changer?\",\"answer\":\"AI Clothes Changer provides a wide range of outfit options, including T-shirt, jeans,sling, dress…. to fit different editing requirements.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"Does the quality of the photo affect the AI Clothes Changer's performance?\",\"answer\":\"For the best results, the AI Clothes Changer works well with clear, high-resolution images. It may not perform as effectively on photos that are blurry or of low quality.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"Can I make multiple clothing changes to a single photo with AI Clothes Changer?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, you can experiment with various outfits and make multiple changes until you find the look you're satisfied with.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"How do I save and share the edited photos after using AI Clothes Changer?\",\"answer\":\"Once you've applied the desired clothing changes, you can save the edited photos to your device.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"Are there any extra charges for using the AI Clothes Changer feature?\",\"answer\":\"Each generation will consume two credits, and there are no other fees.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"p1\":\"Have a different question and can't find the answer you're looking for? Reach out to our support team by email \u003cmailTo\u003e\u003c/mailTo\u003e and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.\"},\"testimonials\":{\"p1\":\"They Love AI Clothes Changer\"}},\"ai-portrait-maker\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"AI Portrait Maker\",\"description\":\"Create AI Art of Specific People or Yourself.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Create AI Art of Specific People or Yourself\",\"p1\":\"This is an innovative AI-driven platform specializing in facial recognition and stylized image creation. Users can upload photos containing faces, and the system will automatically generate unique artistic drawings based on the facial features in the images, offering a personalized artistic experience for users.\",\"get-started\":\"Get Started\",\"examples\":\"Examples:\",\"tip\":\"\u003ccaption\u003eTips:\u003c/caption\u003e\u003cp\u003e※ Upload images of someone you want to customize. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e※ One image is ok, but \u003chighlight\u003emore is better\u003c/highlight\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e※ The face in the uploaded image should \u003chighlight\u003eoccupy the majority\u003c/highlight\u003e of the image.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"prompt\":\"Prompts\",\"prompt-placeholader\":\"a girl is swimming in the deep sea\",\"gender\":\"Gender\u003cspan\u003e(required option!!!)\u003c/span\u003e\",\"male\":\"Male\",\"female\":\"Female\",\"style\":\"Style\",\"upload-image\":\"Upload Image\",\"drop-image\":\"or drop an image here\",\"paste-image\":\"paste image or URL\",\"upload-image-message\":\"Please upload an image file.\",\"paste-image-message\":\"Please paste an image link.\",\"image-blocked-message\":\"\\\"{imgUrl}\\\" cannot be uploaded.\",\"generate\":\"Generate\",\"no-style\":\"(No style)\",\"cinematic\":\"Cinematic\",\"disney-charactor\":\"Disney Charactor\",\"digital-art\":\"Digital Art\",\"photographic-default\":\"Photographic (Default)\",\"fantasy-art\":\"Fantasy art\",\"neonpunk\":\"Neonpunk\",\"enhance\":\"Enhance\",\"comic-book\":\"Comic book\",\"lowpoly\":\"Lowpoly\",\"line-art\":\"Line art\",\"success-message\":\"2 credits have been deducted from your account.\"},\"features\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"Advanced Facial Recognition:\",\"description\":\"AI Portrait Maker utilizes sophisticated facial recognition technology to detect and map out individual facial features with precision, ensuring that each portrait captures the unique characteristics of the subject.\"},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Artistic Style Customization:\",\"description\":\"Users can choose from a diverse range of artistic styles, such as oil painting, watercolor, or digital sketch, to personalize their portraits. AI Portrait Maker's adaptive algorithms ensure that the final artwork harmoniously blends the essence of the chosen style with the subject's likeness.\"},\"3\":{\"name\":\"Efficient Batch Processing:\",\"description\":\"AI Portrait Maker offers a convenient batch processing feature, allowing users to upload multiple photos and receive a series of portraits in the selected style quickly. This functionality is ideal for creating a cohesive collection of artwork from a group of images.\"},\"p1\":\"Create AI Art of Specific People or Yourself \"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"How do I use AI Portrait Maker to create an AI art piece of a specific person?\",\"answer\":\"To create an AI art portrait, simply upload a clear photo of the individual you wish to feature. The AI will analyze the facial features and generate an artistic representation based on the selected style.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"Can I create a self-portrait using AI Portrait Maker?\",\"answer\":\"Absolutely! Just upload a photo of yourself, and the AI will transform it into a unique piece of art that captures your likeness in the style of your choice.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"Are there different artistic styles available for my portraits?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, AI Portrait Maker offers a variety of artistic styles, including classic and modern looks, to suit your personal taste and the mood you want to convey in your portrait.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"How long does it take to generate an AI art portrait?\",\"answer\":\"The generation process is typically quite fast. Once you've uploaded your photo and selected your preferred style, you'll receive your AI art portrait in a matter of minutes.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"Can I request revisions or adjustments to the AI-generated portrait?\",\"answer\":\"While AI Portrait Maker strives for accuracy, the AI-generated art may not be perfect. Depending on the platform's features, you may be able to request minor adjustments or refinements to better match your expectations.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"Is there a limit to the number of portraits I can create with AI Portrait Maker?\",\"answer\":\"Each image generation requires 2 credits, and you can upgrade to a subscription plan to receive more generation credits.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"p1\":\"Have a different question and can't find the answer you're looking for? Reach out to our support team by email \u003cmailTo\u003e\u003c/mailTo\u003e and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.\"},\"testimonials\":{\"p1\":\"They Love AI Portrait Maker\"}},\"sketch-to-image\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Sketch to Image\",\"description\":\"Convert your hand-drawn art into digital image.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Sketch to Image\",\"p1\":\"Transform your artistic sketches into digital masterpieces with Sketch to Image, the intuitive platform that turns your hand-drawn creations into high-quality, shareable images in seconds. Unleash your creativity and bring your visions to life with stunning clarity and vibrant colors.\",\"get-started\":\"Get Started\",\"prompt\":\"Prompts\",\"prompt-placeholader\":\"Please input your prompts\",\"default-prompt\":\"A sunset at a tropical beach with palm trees\",\"style\":\"Style\",\"generate\":\"Generate\",\"no-style\":\"(No style)\",\"cinematic\":\"Cinematic\",\"disney-charactor\":\"Disney Charactor\",\"digital-art\":\"Digital Art\",\"photographic-default\":\"Photographic (Default)\",\"fantasy-art\":\"Fantasy art\",\"neonpunk\":\"Neonpunk\",\"enhance\":\"Enhance\",\"comic-book\":\"Comic book\",\"lowpoly\":\"Lowpoly\",\"line-art\":\"Line art\",\"success-message\":\"1 credit has been deducted from your account.\"},\"features\":{\"1\":{\"name\":\"Instant Artwork Digitization:\",\"description\":\"Sketch to Image rapidly scans and converts your traditional sketches into high-resolution digital images, preserving every detail and nuance of your hand-drawn artwork.\"},\"2\":{\"name\":\"Advanced Image Processing:\",\"description\":\"The platform uses sophisticated algorithms to enhance and refine your drawings, ensuring that the final image is sharp, well-balanced, and true to your artistic vision.\"},\"3\":{\"name\":\"User-Friendly Interface:\",\"description\":\"With an intuitive design, Sketch to Image makes the digitization process effortless, allowing artists of all levels to focus on their creativity rather than technical hurdles.\"},\"p1\":\"Real-Time Drawing Transformation\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"How does the real-time drawing to image conversion work on your platform?\",\"answer\":\"Users can start drawing in real-time within the platform, and each stroke or element they add is automatically converted into a digital image, creating a seamless and interactive artistic experience.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"What are 'credits' and how do they function on the site?\",\"answer\":\"Credits are the virtual currency on our platform that users spend to access the real-time drawing feature. Each time a user starts a new drawing session, it consumes one credit.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"Can I undo or modify my drawings while using the real-time drawing feature?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, our platform provides tools for undoing actions and making modifications, allowing users to refine their drawings in real-time before finalizing them as images.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"How do I acquire more credits if I run out?\",\"answer\":\"You can purchase additional credits through our in-platform store. We offer various packages to suit different usage needs and budgets.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"How do I ensure the privacy of my drawings while using the platform?\",\"answer\":\"We take user privacy very seriously. Your drawings are stored securely, and we have measures in place to protect your work.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"Can I download my finished drawings?\",\"answer\":\"Once you've completed your drawing, you have the option to download it to your device.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\",\"p1\":\"Have a different question and can't find the answer you're looking for? Reach out to our support team by email \u003cmailTo\u003e\u003c/mailTo\u003e and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.\"},\"testimonials\":{\"p1\":\"They Love Sketch to Image\"}},\"ai-tools\":{\"control-net\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"ControlNet - Control Diffusion Models\",\"description\":\"ControlNet Online Demo. ControlNet is a Game Changer for AI Image Generation.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"ControlNet \u003chighlight\u003eOnline\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"p1\":\"ControlNet is a neural network structure to control diffusion models by adding extra conditions, a game changer for AI Image generation. It brings unprecedented levels of control to Stable Diffusion.\",\"p2\":\"The revolutionary thing about ControlNet is its solution to the problem of spatial consistency. Whereas previously there was simply no efficient way to tell an AI model which parts of an input image to keep, ControlNet changes this by introducing a method to enable \u003cunderline\u003eStable Diffusion\u003c/underline\u003e models to use additional input conditions that tell the model exactly what to do\",\"button1\":\"Try ControlNet\",\"button2\":\"Stable Diffusion\"},\"hg-frame\":{\"h2\":\"ControlNet\",\"p\":\"Due to the large number of users, the server may experience problems. If you encounter an error, please try again.\"}},\"stable-diffusion-xl\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Stable Diffusion XL\",\"description\":\"Stable Diffusion XL online.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Stable Diffusion \u003chighlight\u003eXL\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"p1\":\"SDXL - The Best Open Source Image Model\",\"p2\":\"The Stability AI team takes great pride in introducing \u003cunderline\u003eSDXL\u003c/underline\u003e 1.0, an open model representing the next evolutionary step in text-to-image generation models.\",\"p3\":\"SDXL 1.0, the flagship image model developed by Stability AI, stands as the pinnacle of open models for image generation. Through extensive testing and comparison with various other models, the conclusive results show that people overwhelmingly prefer images generated by SDXL 1.0 over other open models.\",\"button1\":\"Get Started with SDXL\",\"button2\":\"Fast Generation with Premium Plan\"},\"hg-frame\":{\"h2\":\"Stable Diffusion XL\",\"p\":\"Due to the large number of users, the server may experience problems. If you encounter an error, please try again.\"}},\"webui\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Stable Diffusion WebUI Online\",\"description\":\"Stable Diffusion WebUI with Controlnet and Inpaint.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Stable Diffusion \u003chighlight\u003eWebUI\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"p1\":\"\u003cunderline\u003eStable Diffusion WebUI\u003c/underline\u003e is a browser interface for Stable Diffusion, an AI model that can generate images from text prompts or modify existing images with text prompts.\",\"p2\":\"AUTOMATIC1111 web UI, which is very intuitive and easy to use, and has features such as outpainting, inpainting, color sketch, prompt matrix, upscale, and attention.\",\"p3\":\"Stable Diffusion web UI is a great way to explore the possibilities of Stable Diffusion and create amazing images with just a few clicks.\",\"button1\":\"Get Started For Free\",\"button2\":\"Stable Diffusion\"},\"hg-frame\":{\"h2\":\"Stable Diffusion XL\",\"p\":\"Due to the large number of users, the server may experience problems. If you encounter an error, please try again.\"}},\"stable-video-diffusion\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Stable Video Diffusion Online\",\"description\":\"Stable Video Diffusion Online. Convert image to video.\"},\"hero\":{\"caption\":{\"1\":\"Stable Video Diffusion\",\"2\":\"Image to Video\"},\"h1\":\"Stable Video Diffusion\",\"p1\":\"Stable Video Diffusion is released in the form of two image-to-video models, capable of generating 14 and 25 frames at customizable frame rates between 3 and 30 frames per second.\",\"p2\":\"Stable Video Diffusion is a groundbreaking innovation in the field of artificial intelligence.\",\"p3\":\"It is a tool that converts static images into dynamic videos using advanced AI algorithms. This technology goes beyond creating motion; it animates imagination, offering a new dimension to visual storytelling.\",\"button1\":\"Get Started Now\",\"button2\":\"Learn more\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"What is Stable Video Diffusion?\",\"answer\":\"Stable Video Diffusion is a foundation model for generative video based on the image model Stable Diffusion. It can create realistic videos from images using a diffusion process.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"How can I access Stable Video Diffusion?\",\"answer\":\"You can access Stable Video Diffusion in research preview by downloading the code from our GitHub repository and the weights from our Hugging Face page. You can also sign up for our waitlist to access a new web experience featuring a Text-To-Video interface.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"What are the capabilities of Stable Video Diffusion?\",\"answer\":\"Stable Video Diffusion can generate 14 and 25 frames at customizable frame rates between 3 and 30 frames per second. It can also be easily adapted to various downstream tasks, such as multi-view synthesis from a single image with finetuning on multi-view datasets.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"How does Stable Video Diffusion compare to other models?\",\"answer\":\"Stable Video Diffusion surpasses the leading closed models in user preference studies. It also inherits the advantages of Stable Diffusion, such as stability, scalability, and interpretability.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"What are the applications of Stable Video Diffusion?\",\"answer\":\"Stable Video Diffusion can be applied to numerous sectors, including Advertising, Education, Entertainment, and beyond. For example, it can create engaging video ads from text descriptions, generate educational videos from images, or synthesize novel scenes from existing images.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"Is Stable Video Diffusion ready for real-world or commercial use?\",\"answer\":\"No, Stable Video Diffusion is not intended for real-world or commercial applications at this stage. It is still in research preview and requires further evaluation and refinement. We emphasize that this model should be used for research purposes only.\"},\"7\":{\"question\":\"How can I provide feedback or report issues on Stable Video Diffusion?\",\"answer\":\"We welcome your feedback and insights on safety and quality of Stable Video Diffusion. You can contact us here or join our Discord Community to share your thoughts and suggestions.\"},\"8\":{\"question\":\"What are the ethical and social implications of Stable Video Diffusion?\",\"answer\":\"Stable Video Diffusion is a powerful tool that can create realistic and diverse videos from images. However, it also poses potential risks and challenges, such as misuse, abuse, or deception. We encourage users to be responsible and ethical when using this model and to adhere to our code of conduct and terms of service.\"},\"9\":{\"question\":\"What are the future plans for Stable Video Diffusion?\",\"answer\":\"We are planning to release a full version of Stable Video Diffusion with more features and improvements. We are also working on developing more models that build on and extend this base, similar to the ecosystem that has built around Stable Diffusion.\"},\"10\":{\"question\":\"Where can I learn more about Stable Video Diffusion and Stability AI?\",\"answer\":\"You can learn more about Stable Video Diffusion by reading our research paper and watching our video demonstration. You can also follow us on Twitter, Instagram, LinkedIn, and sign up for our newsletter to stay updated on our progress and products.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}},\"stable-lm\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"StableLM Web Demo\",\"description\":\"StableLM is a helpful and harmless open-source AI large language model(LLM).\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"StableLM \u003chighlight\u003eOnline\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"p1\":\"StableLM: Empowering the Digital Economy with \u003cunderline\u003eAccessible Language Models\u003c/underline\u003e\",\"p2\":\"As language models (LLMs) become essential components of the digital economy, it's crucial to ensure that they are transparent, accessible, and supportive of all users. StableLM, an exemplary AI technology, showcases our dedication to creating inclusive and powerful LLM solutions for everyone's benefit.\",\"p3\":\"Our cutting-edge LLM, StableLM, delivers exceptional performance in both conversational and coding tasks, thanks to the immense richness of its dataset. What sets StableLM apart is its \u003cunderline\u003eincredible efficiency\u003c/underline\u003e, as it achieves these top-tier results with only 3 to 7 billion parameters – a fraction of GPT-3's 175 billion parameters. Experience the unparalleled technical advantages of StableLM and revolutionize your language modeling capabilities today.\",\"button1\":\"Try Now\",\"button2\":\"Stable Diffusion\"},\"hg-frame\":{\"h2\":\"StableLM Tuned Alpha 7B\",\"p\":\"Check out our online demo below, produced by our 7 billion parameter fine-tuned model.\"}},\"visual-chatgpt\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Visual ChatGPT Online\",\"description\":\"Visual ChatGPT Online Demo. Conversations with AI and Images!\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Visual ChatGPT \u003chighlight\u003eOnline\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"p1\":\"Chatbot can now process images!\",\"p2\":\"Visual ChatGPT connects ChatGPT and a series of Visual Foundation Models to enable sending and receiving images during chatting.\",\"p3\":\"Instead of training a new model, the researchers linked ChatGPT to 22 different Visual Foundation Models (VFM), including \u003cunderline\u003eStable Diffusion\u003c/underline\u003e. Microsoft is integrating into Visual ChatGPT some existing methods for more control over image models with additional models or prompt engineering. There have been several advances in this area in recent months, such as InstructPix2Pix, ControlNet, or GLIGEN.\",\"button1\":\"Get Started For Free\",\"button2\":\"Stable Diffusion\"},\"hg-frame\":{\"h2\":\"Visual ChatGPT\",\"p\":\"Due to the large number of users, the server may experience problems. If you encounter an error, please try again.\"}},\"sdxl-turbo\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"SDXL Turbo Online\",\"description\":\"SDXL Turbo Online Demo. A Real-Time Text-to-Image Generation Model.\"},\"hero\":{\"span\":\"SDXL Turbo\",\"a1\":\"Real-Time Text-to-Image Generation\",\"h1\":\"SDXL Turbo Online\",\"p1\":\"SDXL Turbo is short for Stable Diffusion XL Turbo, which is a new text-to-image model that can generate realistic images from text prompts in a single step and in real time.\",\"p2\":\"With its groundbreaking Adversarial Diffusion Distillation technology, SDXL Turbo sets a new standard for text-to-image generation, delivering stunning images in a single step.\",\"p3\":\"No more waiting for 50 steps of refinement, just enter your text and see the magic happen.\",\"a2\":\"Get Started with SDXL Turbo\",\"a3\":\"Learn more\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"What is SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"SDXL Turbo is a new text-to-image model that can generate realistic images from text prompts in a single step and in real time, using a novel distillation technique called Adversarial Diffusion Distillation (ADD).\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"How does SDXL Turbo work?\",\"answer\":\"SDXL Turbo works by using ADD to distill a large diffusion model into a smaller UNet model, which can then synthesize images from text embeddings in a single forward pass. ADD combines adversarial training and score distillation to achieve high-fidelity image generation.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"How can I test SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"You can test SDXL Turbo on https://stablediffusionweb.com/SDXL-Turbo website, which offers a beta demonstration of the model’s real-time text-to-image generation capabilities. You can access it from your browser and try it for free.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"How can I download SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"You can download the model weights and code of SDXL Turbo on Hugging Face, a platform for sharing and collaborating on machine learning models. The model is currently being released under a non-commercial research license that permits personal, non-commercial use.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"How does SDXL Turbo compare to other text-to-image models?\",\"answer\":\"SDXL Turbo outperforms other state-of-the-art text-to-image models, such as StyleGAN-T++, OpenMUSE, IF-XL, SDXL, and LCM-XL, in terms of image quality and inference speed. SDXL Turbo can generate a 512x512 image in 207ms on an A100 GPU, while maintaining high sampling fidelity and avoiding artifacts or blurriness\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"What are the applications of SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"SDXL Turbo can be used for various applications that require fast and realistic text-to-image generation, such as content creation, image editing, data augmentation, visual storytelling, and more.\"},\"7\":{\"question\":\"What are the limitations of SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"SDXL Turbo is not yet intended for commercial use, and it may have some limitations in terms of diversity, coherence, and robustness. The model may also generate images that are inappropriate, offensive, or harmful, depending on the text input.\"},\"8\":{\"question\":\"What are the ethical implications of SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"SDXL Turbo raises some ethical issues regarding the potential misuse or abuse of the model, such as generating fake or misleading images, violating intellectual property rights, or harming people’s privacy or reputation. Users of the model should be aware of these risks and use the model responsibly and ethically.\"},\"9\":{\"question\":\"Who are the authors of SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"The authors of SDXL Turbo are Joonho Kim, Jaehoon Lee, Seonghyeon Park, Taesung Kim, Minsu Cho, Sungjin Kim, and Junseok Lee, who are affiliated with several institutions in South Korea, such as KAIST, ETRI, and Naver\"},\"10\":{\"question\":\"What is the motivation behind SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"The motivation behind SDXL Turbo is to overcome the limitations of existing text-to-image models, which either require multiple steps of image refinement or suffer from low image quality. The authors wanted to create a model that can generate high-quality images from text in a single step and in real time, using a novel distillation technique.\"},\"11\":{\"question\":\"What is the difference between SDXL Turbo and SDXL 1.0?\",\"answer\":\"SDXL Turbo is an improved version of SDXL 1.0, which was the first text-to-image model based on diffusion models. SDXL Turbo implements a new distillation technique called Adversarial Diffusion Distillation (ADD), which enables the model to synthesize images in a single step and generate real-time text-to-image outputs while maintaining high sampling fidelity.\"},\"12\":{\"question\":\"What is a diffusion model?\",\"answer\":\"A diffusion model is a type of generative model that can synthesize realistic images from random noise by reversing a diffusion process. A diffusion process is a process that gradually adds noise to an image until it becomes completely random. A diffusion model learns to remove the noise and recover the original image by using a neural network.\"},\"13\":{\"question\":\"How can I fine-tune SDXL Turbo on my own dataset?\",\"answer\":\"You can fine-tune SDXL Turbo on your own dataset by following the instructions on the Hugging Face repository, which provides the code and scripts for training and evaluation. You will need to prepare your dataset in a JSON format, where each example consists of an image URL and a text prompt. You will also need to specify the hyperparameters and the model configuration for fine-tuning.\"},\"14\":{\"question\":\"How can I use SDXL Turbo to generate images from my own text prompts?\",\"answer\":\"You can use SDXL Turbo to generate images from your own text prompts by using the https://stablediffusionweb.com/SDXL-Turbo interface, which allows you to enter any text and see the corresponding image generated by the model. You can also adjust the temperature parameter to control the randomness of the image generation.\"},\"15\":{\"question\":\"How can I provide feedback or suggestions for SDXL Turbo?\",\"answer\":\"You can provide feedback or suggestions for SDXL Turbo by contacting the authors via email or by opening an issue or a pull request on the Hugging Face repository. The authors welcome any comments, questions, or contributions that can help improve the model or the code.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}},\"realtime-scribble-diffusion\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Draw Fast\",\"description\":\"Draw Fast. Realtime Scribble Diffusion. Turn your sketch into a refined image using AI.\"},\"hero\":{\"span\":\"Stable Doodle\",\"a1\":\"AI Art Generator\",\"h1\":\"Draw Fast\",\"p1\":\"Turn your sketch into a refined image using AI.\",\"p2\":\"Transform your doodles into real images in seconds.\",\"p3\":\"Easily bring sketch to life by creating charming and character-filled creatures. Infuses them with personality, detail, and a touch of magic.\",\"a2\":\"Get Started with Draw Fast\",\"a3\":\"Learn more\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"What is Draw Fast?\",\"answer\":\"Draw Fast (Realtime Scribble Diffusion) is a web tool that transforms your doodles into realistic images in seconds.You can choose from different styles, such as animal, furniture, landscape, or pixel art, and apply various effects, such as cleanup, relight, replace background, and text remover.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"How does Draw Fast  work ?\",\"answer\":\"Draw Fast  uses a technique called T2I - Adapter, which allows for precise control over the image generation process based on sketches and text prompts.You can draw a simple sketch of what you want to create, and optionally add some text to describe the details, such as color, shape, or texture.Draw Fast  will then generate a realistic image that matches your sketch and text.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"Who created Draw Fast  ?\",\"answer\":\"Draw Fast  is powered by Black Technology LTD, a company that specializes in creating advanced image - generating technology using artificial intelligence.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"How can I use Draw Fast  ?\",\"answer\":\"You can use Draw Fast  for free on the https://stablediffusionweb.com website.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"What are the benefits of using Draw Fast ?\",\"answer\":\"Draw Fast  can help you create high-quality original images for various purposes, such as design, illustration, education, or entertainment.You can use Draw Fast  to express your creativity, enhance your visual communication, or learn new concepts.Draw Fast  can also save you time and money, as you don’t need to hire a professional artist or buy expensive software to create realistic images.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"What are the limitations of Draw Fast  ?\",\"answer\":\"Draw Fast  is not perfect, and it may not always generate the exact image that you want.Draw Fast  may also produce some artifacts, such as blurry edges, distorted shapes, or unrealistic colors.Draw Fast  is not intended to replace human creativity or artistic skills, but rather to augment them.Draw Fast  is also not responsible for the content or quality of the images that you create or share using the tool.\"},\"7\":{\"question\":\"How can I improve the quality of the images generated by Draw Fast  ?\",\"answer\":\"There are some tips and tricks that you can use to improve the quality of the images generated by Draw Fast .For example, you can try to draw clear and simple sketches, use descriptive and specific text prompts, adjust the style and effect settings, or use the undo and redo buttons to experiment with different options.You can also check out the examples and tutorials on the stablediffusionweb.com website or app to get some inspiration and guidance.\"},\"8\":{\"question\":\"Is Draw Fast  safe and secure ?\",\"answer\":\"Draw Fast  is safe and secure, and it respects your privacy and data.Draw Fast  does not store or share any of your sketches, text, or images, unless you choose to do so.Draw Fast  also does not collect or use any of your personal information, such as your name, email, or location.Draw Fast  uses encryption and authentication to protect your data from unauthorized access or misuse.\"},\"9\":{\"question\":\"How can I contact Draw Fast  or provide feedback ?\",\"answer\":\"You can contact Draw Fast  or provide feedback by sending an email .Draw Fast  appreciates your feedback and suggestions, and it strives to improve the tool and user experience.\"},\"10\":{\"question\":\"What are the future plans for Draw Fast  ?\",\"answer\":\"Draw Fast  is constantly working on adding new features and improving the existing ones.Some of the future plans for Draw Fast  include adding more styles and effects, supporting more languages and platforms, integrating with other tools and services, and enabling more customization and collaboration options.Draw Fast  also aims to expand the scope and application of the tool to other domains and fields, such as gaming, education, or healthcare.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}},\"prompt-generator\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Magic Prompt - Stable Diffusion Prompt Generator\",\"description\":\"Generate and improve your Stable Diffusion prompt magically! Simply enter a few concepts and let it improve your prompt. You can then diffuse the prompt.\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"Prompt \u003chighlight\u003eGenerator\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"p1\":\"Prompt Generator is a neural network structure to generate and imporve your stable diffusion prompt magically, which creates professional prompts that will take your artwork to the next level.\",\"p2\":\"Say goodbye to the frustration of coming up with prompts that do not quite fit your vision. Prompt Generator uses advanced algorithms to generate prompts that are tailored to your specific needs, ensuring that your artwork is always on point.\",\"p3\":\"Start using the best \u003cunderline\u003eprompt generator\u003c/underline\u003e for Stable Diffusion. It is \u003cunderline\u003eFREE\u003c/underline\u003e and easy to use. Create detailed prompts for unique AI generated designs.\",\"button1\":\"Get Started\",\"button2\":\"Stable Diffusion\"},\"hg-frame\":{\"h2\":\"Stable Diffusion Prompt Generator\",\"p\":\"Simply enter a few concepts and let it improve your prompt. You can then diffuse the prompt.\"}},\"pixart-alpha\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"PixArt-α Online\",\"description\":\"PixArt-α: Fast Training of Diffusion Transformer for Photorealistic Text-to-Image Synthesis\"},\"hero\":{\"span\":\"PixArt Alpha\",\"a1\":\"AI Art Generator\",\"h1\":\"PIXART-α\",\"p1\":\"PixArt Alpha is a Transformer-based T2I diffusion model that generates photorealistic images from text.\",\"p2\":\"The model’s image generation quality is competitive with state-of-the-art image generators such as Imagen, SDXL, and Midjourney.\",\"p3\":\"PixArt Alpha’s training speed is also significantly faster than existing large-scale T2I models.😅\",\"a2\":\"Generate AI Art with PixArt Alpha\",\"a3\":\"Learn more\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"What is PIXART-α?\",\"answer\":\"PIXART-α is a Transformer-based text-to-image (T2I) diffusion model designed to generate high-quality images while significantly reducing training costs and CO2 emissions. It is competitive with state-of-the-art image generators and supports high-resolution image synthesis up to 1024 × 1024 resolution.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"What makes PIXART-α unique in terms of efficiency?\",\"answer\":\"PIXART-α is unique in its efficiency due to three core designs: training strategy decomposition, an efficient T2I Transformer, and the use of high-informative data. This approach allows it to surpass the training speed of existing large-scale T2I models, significantly reducing cost and CO2 emissions.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"What are the challenges in training advanced text-to-image models?\",\"answer\":\"Advanced text-to-image models require significant computational resources, leading to high costs and CO2 emissions. For example, training models like SDv1.5 and RAPHAEL requires thousands of GPU days and substantial financial investment, which can be a barrier for researchers and entrepreneurs.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"How does PIXART-α improve the training process?\",\"answer\":\"PIXART-α improves the training process by breaking it down into three stages: pixel dependency learning, text-image alignment learning, and high-resolution and aesthetic image generation. This strategy optimizes each aspect of image generation for efficiency and quality.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"What technological advancements are used in PIXART-α?\",\"answer\":\"PIXART-α incorporates cross-attention modules into the Diffusion Transformer (DiT) for text conditions, uses an efficient adaLN-single layer for time conditions, and employs a re-parameterization technique. These advancements help in managing the model's size and efficiency.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"How does PIXART-α address the shortcomings of existing text-image datasets?\",\"answer\":\"PIXART-α addresses these shortcomings by using auto-labeling with the LLaVA vision-language model to generate high-information-density captions, especially focusing on datasets like SAM and JourneyDB that offer diversity and quality in object combinations.\"},\"7\":{\"question\":\"What are the key components in the implementation of PIXART-α?\",\"answer\":\"Key components include the use of the T5 large language model for text encoding, DiT-XL/2 as the base network architecture, a pre-trained VAE from LDM for capturing image features, and the AdamW optimizer. The model is trained on 64 V100 GPUs for about 22 days.\"},\"8\":{\"question\":\"How is PIXART-α evaluated?\",\"answer\":\"PIXART-α is evaluated using metrics like Frechet Inception Distance (FID) on the MSCOCO dataset, compositionality on T2I-CompBench, and a human-preference rate from a user study. These evaluations assess image quality, text-to-image alignment, and overall user preference.\"},\"9\":{\"question\":\"What are the related works in the field of T2I generation?\",\"answer\":\"Related works include Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models (DDPM), Latent Diffusion Model, and Diffusion Transformer (DiT). These models use iterative denoising processes and have been enhanced with Transformer architecture for scalability and efficiency.\"},\"10\":{\"question\":\"What impact does PIXART-α aim to have?\",\"answer\":\"PIXART-α aims to provide new insights to the AIGC community and startups, enabling them to build their own high-quality yet low-cost T2I models. It is hoped that this work will inspire further innovation and advancements in the field of image generation.\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}},\"deep-floyd-if\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"DeepFloyd IF Online\",\"description\":\"IF by DeepFloyd Lab at StabilityAI, Online Demo\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"DeepFloyd IF \u003chighlight\u003eOnline\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"p1\":\"DeepFloyd IF, a novel state-of-the-art open-source text-to-image model with a high degree of photorealism and language understanding. DeepFloyd IF is a modular composed of a frozen text encoder and three cascaded pixel diffusion modules.\",\"p2\":\"DeepFloyd IF, made by DeepFloyd Lab at StabilityAI, is super efficient and does an even better job than other top tools.\",\"p3\":\"DeepFloyd IF shows that bigger UNet structures can make these image-creating tools even better, and DeepFloyd think there is a bright future for turning text into images.\",\"button1\":\"Try DeepFloyd IF\",\"button2\":\"Stable Diffusion\"},\"hg-frame\":{\"h2\":\"DeepFloyd IF Online Demo\",\"p\":\"In this demo, the DeepFloyd team may collect prompts, and user  preferences (which of the images the user chose to upscale) for improving future models\"}},\"chat-gpt\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"ChatGPT Online\",\"description\":\"ChatGPT Online Demo, using the official OpenAI API (gpt-3.5-turbo model)\"},\"hero\":{\"h1\":\"ChatGPT \u003chighlight\u003eOnline\u003c/highlight\u003e\",\"p1\":\"ChatGPT is a revolutionary AI-based tool that has the potential to change the way we communicate with machines.\",\"p2\":\"ChatGPT is a large language model chatbot developed by OpenAI based on GPT-3.5. It has a remarkable ability to interact in conversational dialogue form and provide responses that can appear surprisingly human.\",\"p3\":\"To make it easier for more users to use, we have developed this web app. It calls the \u003cunderline\u003eofficial API\u003c/underline\u003e of OpenAI and can be used without registration. It is \u003cunderline\u003efree\u003c/underline\u003e\",\"button1\":\"Try ChatGPT\",\"button2\":\"Stable Diffusion\"},\"hg-frame\":{\"h2\":\"ChatGPT Online Demo\",\"p\":\"For a more stable experience, please enter your own OpenAI API Key. You can get it \",\"a\":\"here\"}},\"background-replacement\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Background Replacement for Product Images - Stable Diffusion XL\",\"description\":\"Background Replacement for Product Images, makes it easy to use your existing product images to make something new.\"},\"hero\":{\"span\":\"SDXL\",\"a1\":\"for Product Images\",\"h1\":\"Background Replacement\",\"p1\":\"Advanced Background Replacement for Product Images.\",\"p2\":\"Building an online store requires lots of high quality product and marketing images. This is an early demo of a \u003cunderline\u003ebackground replacement tool\u003c/underline\u003e built with Stable Diffusion XL that makes it easy to use your existing product images to make something new.\",\"p3\":\"Please be patient during peak demand. 😅\",\"a2\":\"Get started\",\"a3\":\"Learn more\"},\"tutorial\":{\"p1\":\"Tips\",\"h1\":\"How to get best results?\",\"p2\":\"To use it, upload your product photo (.jpg or .png), then describe the background you’d like to see in place of the original.\",\"p3\":\"For best results follow the general pattern in the examples below:\",\"span1\":\"\u003cstrong\u003eDo not\u003c/strong\u003e describe your product in the prompt (ex: black sneakers)\",\"span2\":\"Do describe the \\\"grounding\\\" for your product (ex: placed on a table)\",\"span3\":\"Do describe the scene you want (ex: in a greek cottage)\",\"span4\":\"Do describe a style of image (ex: side view commercial product photography)\",\"span5\":\"Optionally, describe what you want to avoid in the negative prompt field\"},\"faqs\":{\"1\":{\"question\":\"What kind of product images can I use for the background replacement tool?\",\"answer\":\"You can use any product image that has a clear foreground and a simple background. The tool works best with images that have a single product and a solid or plain background. The image should also be in JPEG or PNG format and have a resolution of at least 256x256 pixels.\"},\"2\":{\"question\":\"How do I describe the background I want to replace?\",\"answer\":\"You can use natural language to describe the background you want to see in place of the original. For example, you can write ‘a white background’, ‘a beach scene’, ‘a gradient of blue and purple’, or ‘a brick wall’. You can also use adjectives and modifiers to make your description more specific, such as ‘a bright white background’, ‘a sunny beach scene’, ‘a smooth gradient of blue and purple’, or ‘a red brick wall’.\"},\"3\":{\"question\":\"What is the negative prompt field and how do I use it?\",\"answer\":\"The negative prompt field is an optional field that allows you to specify what you don’t want in the generated image. For example, if you want to replace the background of a product image with a beach scene, but you don’t want any people or animals in the image, you can write ‘no people, no animals’ in the negative prompt field. This will help the tool avoid generating unwanted elements in the image.\"},\"4\":{\"question\":\"How long does it take to generate an image with the background replacement tool?\",\"answer\":\"The time it takes to generate an image with the background replacement tool depends on the complexity of the input and the demand of the service. Generally, it takes about 10 to 15 seconds to generate an image, but it may take longer during peak hours. Please be patient and do not refresh the page while the image is being generated.\"},\"5\":{\"question\":\"What is Stable Diffusion XL and how does it work?\",\"answer\":\"Stable Diffusion XL is a state-of-the-art text-to-image technology that can generate realistic and high-quality images from natural language descriptions. It works by using a diffusion model that gradually transforms a noisy image into a clear one, guided by the text input.\"},\"6\":{\"question\":\"What is the purpose of this tool ?\",\"answer\":\"This tool is a demonstration of our advanced background replacement tool for product images, powered by Stable Diffusion XL.This cutting-edge text-to-image technology will enable millions of merchants to create stunning and realistic visuals for their products.We are sharing this early demo to get feedback from the community and improve our solution.\"},\"7\":{\"question\":\"Can I use the demo for commercial usage ?\",\"answer\":\"The demo is a preview and not intended for production use, but you are free to use the source code as per the license terms.There is no restriction on commercial use of the code or the generated images.\"},\"8\":{\"question\":\"What data is you collecting ?\",\"answer\":\"We are not collecting any usage data from this website. We are offering this demo as a way to showcase our innovation and get direct feedback from the community.We would love to hear your thoughts and suggestions!\"},\"9\":{\"question\":\"I got a weird image, can I report it or send it to you ?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, please! We appreciate your help in identifying any issues or anomalies.Please report any strange or unexpected results with the image and relevant details in the community channel.It will help us fine-tune and enhance the tool for future users.\"},\"10\":{\"question\":\"Are there any limitations to the background replacement tool?\",\"answer\":\"This tool is currently in its early stages and you may encounter some edge cases that do not work as expected.Please share these examples with us.We thank you for your patience and feedback as we work to improve the technology!\"},\"h2\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}}},\"saas\":{\"image-generator\":{\"generator\":{\"error-message\":{\"TIMEOUT\":\"Server timeout, please try again. \u003cnewline\u003eThis time will not deduct any credits from your account.\u003c/newline\u003e\",\"NSFW\":\"We may have generated inappropriate or NSFW content. \u003cnewline\u003eThis time will not deduct any credits from your account.\u003c/newline\u003e\",\"NSFW_1\":\"We may have generated inappropriate or NSFW content. \u003cnewline\u003eThis time will not deduct any credits from your account.\u003c/newline\u003e\",\"IMG_SERVER_ERROR\":\"Image generation error on the server, please try again. \u003cnewline\u003eThis time will not deduct any credits from your account.\u003c/newline\u003e\",\"SERVER_BUSY\":\"Server is busy, please try again later. \u003cnewline\u003eThis time will not deduct any credits from your account.\u003c/newline\u003e\",\"add-task-default\":\"Could not generate image at this time. Please try again later.\",\"get-task-default\":\"Could not generate image at this time. Please try again later.\",\"check-task-default\":\"Some images failed to process.\",\"deleted\":\"This image has already been deleted.\",\"COPYRIGHT\":\"\\nThe image you generated may have infringed copyright.\u003cnewline\u003eNo credits will be deducted from your account this time.\u003c/newline\u003e\",\"CELEBRITY\":\"\\nThe image you generated may infringe on the publicity rights of celebrities. \u003cnewline\u003eNo credits will be deducted from your account this time.\u003c/newline\u003e\"},\"removeMarkMsg\":\"Upgrading the plan can remove the watermark\",\"upgrade\":\"Upgrade\",\"contactus\":\"Feedback Email: yuki@stablediffusionweb.com\",\"upgrade-plan\":{\"p1\":\"You are currently on a free plan.\",\"p2\":\"Upgrade for priority generations, additional token credits, no ads and much more!\",\"button\":\"Upgrade Plan\"},\"contour\":{\"title\":\"Copy Contour\",\"desc\":\"Generate with same contour but much more amazing images\"},\"pose\":{\"title\":\"Copy Pose\",\"desc\":\"Control generated characters to replicate the exact pose of your uploaded image\"},\"sketch\":{\"title\":\"Sketch to Image\",\"desc\":\"Turn simple drawings into stunning full-color images\"}},\"generator-form\":{\"invalid-prompts-message\":\"Please enter valid prompts, only allowing entering English letters, numbers, and half-width punctuation marks with a minimum of 3 characters and a maximum of 500 characters.\",\"enter-prompts-message\":\"Please enter some prompts.\",\"upload-image-message\":\"Please upload an image.\",\"from-text\":\"From Text\",\"from-image\":\"From Image\",\"image-span\":\"Upload a file\",\"image-p1\":\"or drag and drop\",\"image-p2\":\"PNG, JPG, GIF up to 10MB\",\"textarea-placeholder\":\"Describe anything in your mind, use short sentences, separated by commas.\",\"add-negative-prompt\":\"Add Negative Prompt\",\"negative-prompt-placeholder\":\"Type what you don't want to see in the image. (a negative prompt)...\",\"guidance-scale\":\"Guidance Scale\",\"guidance-scale-tooltip\":\"How strongly your prompt is weighed\",\"image-guidance-scale\":\"Image Guidance Scale\",\"guidance-scale-warning\":\"Note that a high/low guidance scale can produce unwanted results and image degradation. We recommend using a guidance scale of around {scale}.\",\"advanced-controls\":\"Advanced Controls\",\"use-fixed-seed\":\"Use Fixed Seed\",\"use-fixed-seed-tooltip\":\"The deterministic number for the random number generator.\",\"choose-model\":\"Style\",\"style-realista\":\"This model has a very strong text understanding capability, and if your prompt is detailed enough, it can create realistic images. Note: If your prompt is too short, you may not achieve good results.\",\"style-photographic\":\"We highly recommend you try this model. It has powerful natural language understanding capabilities, making it suitable for creating complex compositions.\",\"style-warning\":\"If you choose a style other than None, it is recommended that the prompt does not exceed 10 words, otherwise it may affect the effectiveness of the style.\",\"aspect-ratio\":\"Aspect Ratio\",\"number-of-images\":\"Number of images\",\"less\":\"Less\",\"more\":\"More\",\"processing-button-text\":\"Processing...\",\"generate-button-text\":\"Generate\",\"display-names\":{\"Default\":\"Default\",\"None\":\"None\",\"sai-photographic-classic\":\"Photographic-classic\",\"cinematic-default\":\"Cinematic\",\"sai-analog film\":\"Analog Film\",\"sai-anime\":\"Animation\",\"sai-comic book\":\"Comic Book\",\"sai-craft clay\":\"Craft Clay\",\"sai-fantasy art\":\"Fantasy Art\",\"sai-line art\":\"Line Art\",\"sai-neonpunk\":\"Cyberpunk\",\"sai-photographic\":\"Photograph\",\"realista\":\"Realistic\",\"sai-pixel art\":\"Pixel Art\",\"artstyle-graffiti\":\"Graffiti\",\"Doodle Art\":\"Doodle Art\",\"game-gta\":\"Game GTA\",\"papercraft-paper quilling\":\"Papercraft Paper\",\"Adorable 3D Character\":\"3D Character\",\"Baroque\":\"Baroque\",\"Caricature\":\"Caricature\",\"Colored Pencil Art\":\"Colored Pencil\",\"Futurism\":\"Futurism\",\"Impressionism\":\"Impressionism\",\"Pencil Sketch Drawing\":\"Sketch\",\"Neo-Rococo\":\"Rococo\",\"Surrealism\":\"Surrealism\",\"Sticker Designs\":\"Sticker Designs\"},\"confirmDialog\":{\"desc\":\"Exclusive for subscribers: Generate 4 images in one go.\",\"got-it\":\"Got it\",\"subscribe\":\"Subscribe Now\"}},\"history-images\":{\"h2\":\"Image available for 7 days. Download soon.\",\"dialog\":{\"delete\":\"Delete\",\"download\":\"Download\",\"copied-to-clipboard\":\"Copied to Clipboard.\"},\"confirmDialog\":{\"title\":\"Confirmation\",\"desc\":\"Are you sure that you want to delete this image?\",\"delete-note\":\"Please note that all image variations associated with this image will also be deleted.\",\"no\":\"No\",\"yes\":\"Yes\"},\"unlockDialog\":{\"title\":\"AI Image Upscaler  [Premium]\",\"desc\":\"Upscale and enhance your image up to 4K, by using our latest AI technology.\",\"no\":\"Maybe Later\",\"yes\":\"Unlock with Premium\",\"before\":\"Before\",\"after\":\"After\",\"upscale-now\":\"Upscale Now\"},\"upscaleDialog\":{\"title\":\"More Image Upscalers\",\"upscale\":\"Upscale\",\"close\":\"Close\",\"view\":\"View\",\"original\":\"Original\",\"two-fold-title\":\"HD Smooth Upscale\",\"two-fold-desc\":\"An upscaler that works well with a focused subject, but can end up smoothing out fine detail. The image can be enlarged by up to 2 times (200%).\",\"four-fold-title\":\"Ultimate Upscale\",\"four-fold-desc\":\"This can improve images during the upscaling process, but might make slight changes for better quality outputs. The image can be enlarged by up to 4 times (400%).\"},\"upgrade-plan-tooltip\":\"Use this to refine and upscale your images\",\"delete-tooltip\":\"Delete\",\"download-tooltip\":\"Download\",\"copy-tooltip\":\"Copy\"},\"image-area\":{\"waiting-to-start\":\"Waiting to start...\",\"generating\":\"Generating...\"}}},\"image\":{\"meta\":{\"h2\":\"AI Art Image Prompt\",\"button1\":\"Copy Prompt\",\"span1\":\"Prompt:\",\"span1_1\":\"Negative prompt:\",\"span2\":\"Style:\",\"span3\":\"Aspect ratio:\",\"span4\":\"Size:\",\"span5\":\"Tags:\",\"span6\":\"Seed:\",\"span7\":\"Created at:\",\"button2\":\"Download\",\"button3\":\"Open in editor\",\"copied-to-clipboard\":\"Copied to Clipboard.\",\"share-to\":\"Share To\",\"copy-url\":\"Copy URL\"},\"analyze\":{\"h2\":\"AI Art Prompt Analyze\",\"overall\":\"Overall\",\"realism\":\"Realism\",\"diversity\":\"Diversity\",\"innovation\":\"Innovation\",\"logical-consistency\":\"Logical Consistency\",\"score\":\"Score:\"},\"related-images\":{\"title\":\"Related Images\",\"more\":\"Load More\"}},\"private-policy\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Private Policy\",\"description\":\"Private Policy\"},\"h1\":\"Private Policy\",\"p1\":\"Your privacy is important to us. It is Stable Diffusion Online's policy to respect your privacy regarding any information we may collect from you across our website, and other sites we own and operate.\",\"p2\":\"We only ask for personal information when we truly need it to provide a service to you. We collect it by fair and lawful means, with your knowledge and consent. We also let you know why we're collecting it and how it will be used.\",\"p3\":\"You can sign up with your Google account so your Stable Diffusion Online's account username will be prefilled with your name and your public profile picture.\",\"p4\":\"We only retain collected information for as long as necessary to provide you with your requested service. What data we store, we'll protect within commercially acceptable means to prevent loss and theft, as well as unauthorised access, disclosure, copying, use or modification.\",\"p5\":\"We don't share any personally identifying information publicly or with third-parties, except when required to by law.\",\"p6\":\"We act in the capacity of a data controller and a data processor with regard to the personal data processed through Stable Diffusion Online and the services in terms of the applicable data protection laws, including the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).\",\"p7\":\"Our website may link to external sites that are not operated by us. Please be aware that we have no control over the content and practices of these sites, and cannot accept responsibility or liability for their respective privacy policies.\",\"p8\":\"You are free to refuse our request for your personal information, with the understanding that we may be unable to provide you with some of your desired services.\",\"p9\":\"Your continued use of our website will be regarded as acceptance of our practices around privacy and personal information. If you have any questions about how we handle user data and personal information, feel free to contact us.\"},\"terms-and-conditions\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Terms and Conditions\",\"description\":\"Terms and Conditions\"},\"h1\":\"Terms and Conditions\",\"p1\":\"1. Introduction\",\"p2\":\"By using Stable Diffusion Online you confirm your acceptance of, and agree to be bound by, these terms and conditions. Stable Diffusion Online is a online SaaS created by Black Technology LTD.\",\"p3\":\"2. Agreement to Terms and Conditions\",\"p4\":\"This Agreement takes effect on the date on which you first use the Stable Diffusion Online application.\",\"p5\":\"3. Unlimited Access Software License with Termination Rights\",\"p6\":\"The Stable Diffusion Online Software License facilitates the acquisition of Black Technology LTD through a subscription purchase, granting users unrestricted and perpetual access to its comprehensive functionalities. Tailored for independent creators, entrepreneurs, and small businesses, Stable Diffusion Online empowers users to create AI Art images.\",\"p7\":\"This license entails a straightforward and flexible arrangement, exempting users from recurring fees or subscriptions. However, it is important to acknowledge that the licensor retains the right to terminate the license without conditions or prerequisites. This termination provision enables the licensor to exercise control over software distribution and utilization.\",\"p8\":\"Opting for the Stable Diffusion Online Software License enables users to enjoy the benefits of the software while recognizing the licensor's unrestricted termination rights, which provide adaptability and address potential unforeseen circumstances.\",\"p9\":\"4. Refunds\",\"p10\":\"We do not accept refund requests, please think twice before subscribing.\",\"p11\":\"5. Disclaimer\",\"p12\":\"It is not warranted that Stable Diffusion Online will meet your requirements or that its operation will be uninterrupted or error free. All express and implied warranties or conditions not stated in this Agreement (including without limitation, loss of profits, loss or corruption of data, business interruption or loss of contracts), so far as such exclusion or disclaimer is permitted under the applicable law are excluded and  expressly disclaimed. This Agreement does not affect your statutory rights.\",\"p13\":\"6. Warranties and Limitation of Liability\",\"p14\":\"$1e\",\"p15\":\"7. Responsibilities\",\"p16\":\"Stable Diffusion Online is not responsible for what the user does with the user-generated \u0026 ai-generated content.\",\"p17\":\"8. General Terms and Law\",\"p18\":\"This Agreement is governed by the laws of UK. You acknowledge that no joint venture, partnership, employment, or agency relationship exists between you and Stable Diffusion Online as a result of your use of these services. You agree not to hold yourself out as a representative, agent or employee of Stable Diffusion Online. You agree that Stable Diffusion Online will not be liable by reason of any representation, act or omission to act by you.\"},\"app-download\":{\"download1\":{\"title\":\"Download Our App Now!\",\"description\":\"Experience the power of AI in your pocket.\"},\"download2\":{\"title\":\"Transform Your Ideas into Art in Seconds!\",\"description\":\"Unlock the limitless potential of AI-powered creativity. Create stunning, unique images anytime, anywhere with just a tap!\"}}},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"segmentPath\":[\"children\",\"$9\",\"children\"],\"loading\":\"$undefined\",\"loadingStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"loadingScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"hasLoading\":false,\"error\":\"$20\",\"errorStyles\":[],\"errorScripts\":[],\"template\":[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$L21\",\"notFoundStyles\":[],\"styles\":null}]}],[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"21:E{\"digest\":\"NEXT_REDIRECT;replace;/404;307;\"}\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"23:I[38726,[\"4393\",\"static/chunks/4393-75ca70844ee74ae8.js\",\"8827\",\"static/chunks/8827-5b776cdf7b934828.js\",\"5240\",\"static/chunks/5240-75a214